00:09:57.560 --> 00:10:00.040
Training data collected there will target warehouse

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:01.460
and logistics tasks.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:04.720
Tesla's own Optimus timeline at gigatexus

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:07.060
remains the benchmark for volume comparison.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:10.300
The new center will accelerate agility's path

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:11.880
